    "created_at": "2018-02-02T15:10:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-02T15:10:26Z",
    "body": "Note, we are removing `window.applicationCache` when its disabled.  An alternative that has been thrown around is leaving it there, but making it simply do nothing.  I think we want to avoid that if we can, but I guess it depends on how breaking things are in practice.\r\n\r\nAlso note, we never exposed an `ApplicationCache` interface on the global.  So if there are sites doing `\"ApplicationCache\" in self` for their feature detection then we were already getting false on firefox.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
