    "created_at": "2018-02-02T18:20:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-02T18:20:37Z",
    "body": "> more or less the behavior Firefox has landed on as well.\r\n\r\nThis sounds about right. These change are still behind the pref because of the phased roll-out but essentially the plan is to:\r\n- Parse `manifest=` in the HTML parser but ignore it's usage in insecure contexts\r\n- Hide all interfaces used by application cache in insecure contexts (I missed an internal one in this [follow up bug](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1435261)) ",
